        EEschematic: Multimodal-LLM Based AI <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span> for Schematic Generation of Analog Circuit
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+C">Chang Liu</a>, 
      
