        Value-Based Large Language Model <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span> Simulation for Mutual Evaluation of Trust and Interpersonal Closeness
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sakamoto%2C+Y">Yuki Sakamoto</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Uchida%2C+T">Takahisa Uchida</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ishiguro%2C+H">Hiroshi Ishiguro</a>
      
