        Don&#39;t Trust Generative <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agents</span> to Mimic Communication on Social Networks Unless You Benchmarked their Empirical Realism
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=M%C3%BCnker%2C+S">Simon Münker</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Schwager%2C+N">Nils Schwager</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Rettinger%2C+A">Achim Rettinger</a>
      
