      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+X">Xingyu Liu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Fei%2C+L">Leyan Fei</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Cheng%2C+Y">Yuming Cheng</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yi%2C+L">Lilin Yi</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Hu%2C+W">Weisheng Hu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhuge%2C+Q">Qunbi Zhuge</a>
      
    </p>
    
    <p class="abstract mathjax">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Abstract</span>:
      <span class="abstract-short has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2504.01234v2-abstract-short" style="display: inline;">
        We demonstrate the first cross-domain cross-layer level-4 autonomous optical network via a multi-AI-agent system. Field trials show ~98% task completion rate across the distributed AI training lifecycle-3.2x higher than single agents using state-of-the-art LLMs.
        
      </span>
      <span class="abstract-full has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2504.01234v2-abstract-full" style="display: none;">
        We demonstrate the first cross-domain cross-layer level-4 autonomous optical network via a multi-AI-agent system. Field trials show ~98% task completion rate across the distributed AI training lifecycle-3.2x higher than single agents using state-of-the-art LLMs.
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('2504.01234v2-abstract-full').style.display = 'none'; document.getElementById('2504.01234v2-abstract-short').style.display = 'inline';">&#9651; Less</a>
      </span>
    </p>
    

    <p class="is-size-7"><span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Submitted</span> 20 October, 2025; <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">v1</span> submitted 1 April, 2025;
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">originally announced</span> April 2025.
      
    </p>
    
    <p class="comments is-size-7">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Comments:</span>
      <span class="has-text-grey-dark mathjax">Accepted by 51st European Conference on Optical Communication (ECOC 2025), paper W.02.01.177</span>
    </p>
    

    

    
